        duration: "14 Days / 13 Nights (2 Nights Cairo - 1 Night Sleeper Train -  3 Nights Nile Cruise (Aswan& Luxor) - 2 Nights Sharm El- Sheikh - 1 Night St. Catherine - 2 Nights Petra - 1 Night Wadi Rum - 1 Night Amman)",
